    summary_60s: 'CONTENT The Promise of the Holy Spirit (John 14:15-28, 16:5-16, Acts 1:3-5) The Ascension of Jesus Christ (Acts 1:9-11) Functions of the Holy Spirit The Significance of the Holy Spirit The Fruit of the Holy Spirit (Galatians 5:22-23) The Promise of the Holy Spirit Who is the Holy',
