    summary_60s: 'The phrase "a man after God\'s own heart" is famously used in the Bible to describe King David. It appears in both the Old Testament and the New Testament (1 Samuel and Acts), highlighting David\'s unique relationship with God. Below, we explore key aspects of David\'s life, his fai',
