    summary_60s: '2 Kings 22–23 King Josiah’s reign in Judah marked a pivotal moment in the nation’s religious history. His rule was characterized by a series of comprehensive reforms aimed at restoring proper worship of Yahweh and eliminating idolatry. 1. Cleansing and Repair of the Temple Event ',
